ng a second incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ENC2qQnswPbnEuxGYZT9CB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial_failure, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west/eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions. Current state: all three regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and validated.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2-2025"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was the unhealthy one.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted with an orchestrator partial failure after us-east, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried once and it completed.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy, with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n- **Incident:** The first create request timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, so only one incident was opened. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for on-call: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback. Don't redeploy v2.3.1 until it's fixed and validated.", "type": "text"}]}]}